        "content": "## Inbox triage\nInbound email (Postmark-style JSON; the Mailpit bridge sends it for mail to hello@kestrelprint.example) is **classified by the AI gateway**: sales lead, support, invoice, spam or other, with the fields each queue needs.\n\nThe gateway **checks every value against the email**, only routes invoices from known vendors, and sends anything unsure, unknown or suspicious (text addressed to an AI) to the **review queue**. A reviewer's decision resumes this execution at *Wait for reviewer*.",
